{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"989be4d0-305c-4bf2-91e5-a78d3c4d8272","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events defined in [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-4uOIir/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented using the existing [`Analytics.capture`](file:///tmp/h-4uOIir/lib/analytics.dart#L13-L14) wrapper.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[RegistrationScreen](file:///tmp/h-4uOIir/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Dispatched once when the user begins typing into the email field (no PII sent).\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Dispatched once when the user begins typing into the phone field (no PII sent).\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Dispatched when the loan slider is moved with property `amount` (`int`).\n   - `terms_accepted`: Dispatched when the user checks the terms and conditions checkbox.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Dispatched when the continue button is tapped with properties `amount` (`int`) and `terms` (`bool`).\n\n2. **[OfferScreen](file:///tmp/h-4uOIir/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Dispatched when the offers list is scrolled using a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollNotification\u003e` listening for `ScrollUpdateNotification`, passing `offset` (`double`).\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-4uOIir/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Documented the changes made across both screens.\n","duration_seconds":79.290529,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":173256,"output_tokens":3892,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":116259,"total_tokens":177148}}}
